ose  shopping areas again trying to make sure  everybody's safe  absolutely you know what and that's what  kind of what it boils down to be aware  of your surroundings  try to avoid letting others know what  items of value that you have and that  will go a long way toward  helping you  not become the victim of crime  all right thank you
 

